# Minecraft Bedrock pack cache

When publishing `.mcaddon` packs:

1. Always generate new pack + module UUIDs for each user-facing release.
2. Always use a new versioned filename (`*-Reloaded-vX.Y.Z.mcaddon`).
3. Bump versions and make in-game greet strings unique.
